# Scrub speed on the 10% section with a powerslide: sliding friction (0.6 g) against gravity along
# the slope (1.2 m/s^2) takes about 4.7 m/s off per second. Let go and the board swings back in line.
park lab
spawn lab_hill_ten
cmd 6 speed 15
hold slide 20..140
run 220
expect event powerslide{on=true} within 20..22
expect skater.speed < 10.5 at 140
expect skater.speed > 8.5 at 140
expect max skater.slip < 0.05 over 200..220
expect no event bail
